dsh-pavement-structural-dynamics
==================================

This package is a STUDY AID and CRITICAL COMMENTARY derived from the Chinese monograph
《路面结构动力学》 (Pavement Structural Dynamics), published by 人民交通出版社
(China Communications Press).

What this package is:

  * a structured paraphrase of the book's arguments, written in our own words, with page
    references so a reader can check every claim against the printed book;
  * an ERRATA REGISTER: roughly a hundred transcription defects, internal contradictions and
    numbering faults found while distilling the book are documented card by card, each with
    the page and, where possible, a recomputation that demonstrates the defect. This register
    is the package's own contribution;
  * a boundary statement: four of the book's eight chapters promise substantially more than
    they deliver, and the package says so rather than papering over it.

What this package is NOT:

  * it is not the book, and cannot substitute for it. Anyone who needs the book's actual
    derivations, tables or figures must obtain the book;
  * it contains no verbatim passages. An automated check against five separate transcriptions
    of the source found a longest shared run of zero characters across all 59 cards; the only
    ten-character match anywhere in the package is a chapter title used as a table label, which
    is registered as a structural exemption;
  * all formulas are marked unchecked against the printed page, and all numbers are marked as
    transcription values.

